{"meta":{"seed":n:40b0920000000000,"ticksRequested":n:40c0e00000000000,"founders":[{"name":s:"Ask the First","traits":{"curiosity":n:3feccccccccccccd,"social":n:3fd999999999999a,"diligence":n:3fe3333333333333,"conformity":n:3fd3333333333333,},},{"name":s:"Embla the First",},{"traits":{"social":n:3feb333333333333,},},null,],"engine":s:"emergence-engine.js","engineVersion":s:"2.6.0",},"events":[{"id":n:0000000000000000,"tick":n:0000000000000000,"day":n:3ff0000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"start","txt":s:"🌍 Four humans wake in an untouched world: <b>Ask the First</b>, <b>Embla the First</b>, <b>Embla</b>, <b>Torv</b>. They know nothing — but they can observe everything. What will they create?",},{"id":n:3ff0000000000000,"tick":n:401c000000000000,"day":n:3ff0000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"📖 <b>Ask the First</b> told the day back as a story worth remembering — <b>Ask the First's the tale</b> (Storytelling) has been invented! <i>The first culture — memory shaped into meaning.</i>","tech":s:"storytelling","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404b800000000000,"y":n:4040000000000000,"causes":[],},{"id":n:4000000000000000,"tick":n:4024000000000000,"day":n:3ff0000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Embla the First</b> tried something with  — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4000000000000000,},{"id":n:4008000000000000,"tick":n:4030000000000000,"day":n:3ff0000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Ask the First</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404c69121b743333,"y":n:403fced5595c6667,},{"id":n:4010000000000000,"tick":n:4052800000000000,"day":n:4010000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Embla</b> noticed that a struck string and a hollow log ring with a voice. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"soundsRing","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:40472e8c0a61ee40,"y":n:404223f4bb9956ad,},{"id":n:4014000000000000,"tick":n:405cc00000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Torv</b> and <b>Embla</b> have had a child, <b>Liv</b> — generation 2. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:4046e289a32c2571,"y":n:4042c3b51530724c,"causes":[s:"agent:4",s:"agent:3",],},{"id":n:4018000000000000,"tick":n:405d000000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ The first winter has come. The world turns white and hard, and the nights grow long. Fire is no longer comfort — it is life.",},{"id":n:401c000000000000,"tick":n:405d800000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🔥 <b>Embla</b> rubbed sticks together until a spark caught the tinder — <b>Embla's blaze</b> (Fire) has been invented! <i>Warmth at night. Opens the path to pottery and smithing.</i>","tech":s:"fire","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:4046c33e0e61cd57,"y":n:40430794d005adfe,"causes":[],},{"id":n:4020000000000000,"tick":n:405d800000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Embla</b> was known as <b>Embla the Firebringer</b>.","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:4046c33e0e61cd57,"y":n:40430794d005adfe,},{"id":n:4022000000000000,"tick":n:405e000000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Embla</b> noticed that a bent branch fights to spring back. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"branchBends","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:4046c33e0e61cd57,"y":n:40430794d005adfe,},{"id":n:4024000000000000,"tick":n:4060c00000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Torv</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:40477a2e24b28bd8,"y":n:404255aad08ba580,},{"id":n:4026000000000000,"tick":n:4061000000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Embla the Firebringer</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:4045d04907689a24,"y":n:40424e4f7c307aca,},{"id":n:4028000000000000,"tick":n:4061200000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Ask the First</b> began believing the sky-wheel turns with the seasons and can be read like tracks in snow — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(the Sky-Wheel)</i>","custom":s:"c1","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404e306c1260bf6b,"y":n:403a2e56af6b3d72,"label":s:"A NEW WAY OF SEEING",},{"id":n:402a000000000000,"tick":n:4061200000000000,"day":n:4018000000000000,"year":n:3ff0000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 <b>Ask the First</b> saw a pattern in the stars and gave it a name — <b>the Sky-Wheel</b>. From watching, a cosmology is born: the first faith of the sky.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"label":s:"A RELIGION OF THE SKY",},{"id":n:402c000000000000,"tick":n:4062000000000000,"day":n:401c000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:402e000000000000,"tick":n:4062600000000000,"day":n:401c000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🪢 <b>Embla</b> twisted grass fibers into something strong — <b>Embla's braid</b> (Rope) has been invented! <i>Makes it possible to bind parts together.</i>","tech":s:"rope","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404595d5daddcd57,"y":n:404223cb0f077aca,"causes":[],},{"id":n:4030000000000000,"tick":n:4062600000000000,"day":n:401c000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Embla</b> began believing the world repeats and can be understood — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(The Knowing Eye)</i>","custom":s:"c2","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404595d5daddcd57,"y":n:404223cb0f077aca,"label":s:"A NEW WAY OF SEEING",},{"id":n:4031000000000000,"tick":n:4064000000000000,"day":n:401c000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🧶 <b>Embla</b> crossed threads over threads until cloth grew on the frame — <b>Embla's warp-craft</b> (Weaving) has been invented! <i>Cloth for warmth and trade — and hands that specialize.</i>","tech":s:"weaving","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404557ca1e3833be,"y":n:4041c873977eadfe,"causes":[s:"ev:15",],},{"id":n:4032000000000000,"tick":n:4068000000000000,"day":n:4022000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Torv</b> taught <b>Liv</b> the secret of Ask the First's the tale. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"storytelling",},{"id":n:4033000000000000,"tick":n:406ca00000000000,"day":n:4024000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Embla the First</b> starved to death.","agent":n:4000000000000000,"x":n:404a7fd6fefde6ec,"y":n:403bbda41ecf8a02,"cause":s:"starvation","causes":[s:"cause:starvation",],},{"id":n:4034000000000000,"tick":n:406fc00000000000,"day":n:4026000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Embla the Firebringer</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:4008000000000000,},{"id":n:4035000000000000,"tick":n:4070400000000000,"day":n:4028000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4036000000000000,"tick":n:4071d00000000000,"day":n:402a000000000000,"year":n:4000000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🔢 <b>Ask the First</b> matched pebble to sheep and found number itself — <b>Ask the First's number</b> (Counting) has been invented! <i>The world made countable — trade, calendars and mathematics begin.</i>","tech":s:"numbers","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404bf1702d0f9eba,"y":n:4042d17be24b12ee,"causes":[],},{"id":n:4037000000000000,"tick":n:4072e00000000000,"day":n:402a000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Ask the First</b> noticed that struck stone breaks into sharp shards. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"sharpShards","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404b44a4e772cf9b,"y":n:404525e1f8319359,},{"id":n:4038000000000000,"tick":n:4073000000000000,"day":n:402a000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"hoard","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Ask the First</b> has begun laying up stores beyond any need. The pile grows — and eyes have begun to follow it.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404b892f34e502ce,"y":n:404554daddb66026,"causes":[s:"agent:1",],},{"id":n:4039000000000000,"tick":n:4073600000000000,"day":n:402c000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🔪 <b>Ask the First</b> struck two stones together and kept the sharp shard — <b>Ask the First's knife</b> (Sharpened stone) has been invented! <i>Faster gathering of everything.</i>","tech":s:"sharp","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404b892f34e502ce,"y":n:404554daddb66026,"causes":[],},{"id":n:403a000000000000,"tick":n:4079400000000000,"day":n:4032000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:403b000000000000,"tick":n:4079500000000000,"day":n:4032000000000000,"year":n:4008000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Torv</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:4010000000000000,},{"id":n:403c000000000000,"tick":n:407b000000000000,"day":n:4033000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:403d000000000000,"tick":n:407e900000000000,"day":n:4035000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Liv</b> taught <b>Embla</b> the secret of Ask the First's number. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"numbers",},{"id":n:403e000000000000,"tick":n:407f600000000000,"day":n:4036000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🎵 <b>Embla</b> found that a struck string and a voice could ring together — <b>Embla's the song</b> (Music) has been invented! <i>Song at the fire — the root of every art to come.</i>","tech":s:"song","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404abb25e5acccea,"y":n:404599c7eb366688,"causes":[s:"ev:1",],},{"id":n:403f000000000000,"tick":n:407fe00000000000,"day":n:4036000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"📅 <b>Embla</b> counted the stars and seasons into a fixed wheel of days — <b>Embla's star-count</b> (Calendar) has been invented! <i>The future made plannable — harvest, festival and rite find their day.</i>","tech":s:"calendar","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404a9c6ac966ccea,"y":n:404572e29bf099bb,"causes":[s:"ev:22",],},{"id":n:4040000000000000,"tick":n:4080000000000000,"day":n:4036000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Ask the First</b> noticed that spilled seeds sprout where they fall. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"seedsSprout","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404d43fdfc550fa0,"y":n:404746c79a362ad7,},{"id":n:4040800000000000,"tick":n:4080f00000000000,"day":n:4037000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Torv</b> the secret of Embla's braid. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"rope",},{"id":n:4041000000000000,"tick":n:4081200000000000,"day":n:4038000000000000,"year":n:4010000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4041800000000000,"tick":n:4082500000000000,"day":n:4039000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Torv</b> taught <b>Liv</b> the secret of Embla's braid. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"rope",},{"id":n:4042000000000000,"tick":n:4083380000000000,"day":n:403a000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Embla</b> noticed that certain leaves ease pain and close a wound. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"herbsHeal","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404d279e7840c030,"y":n:404704a79dc5f6ef,},{"id":n:4042800000000000,"tick":n:4085a00000000000,"day":n:403e000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4043000000000000,"tick":n:4085d00000000000,"day":n:403e000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask the First</b> taught <b>Embla</b> the secret of Ask the First's knife. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"sharp",},{"id":n:4043800000000000,"tick":n:4086100000000000,"day":n:403e000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🗡️ <b>Ask the First</b> lashed a sharp point to a long shaft — <b>Ask the First's javelin</b> (Spear) has been invented! <i>Humans are prey no longer. Deer can be hunted — food even in winter.</i>","tech":s:"spear","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404c1dc68f7befa6,"y":n:40450abdf0137d63,"causes":[s:"ev:25",s:"ev:15",],},{"id":n:4044000000000000,"tick":n:4086100000000000,"day":n:403e000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Ask the First</b> was known as <b>Ask the First the Spearmaker</b>.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404c1dc68f7befa6,"y":n:40450abdf0137d63,},{"id":n:4044800000000000,"tick":n:4086480000000000,"day":n:403e000000000000,"year":n:4014000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🪓 <b>Ask the First</b> bound a hard edge to a wooden shaft — <b>Ask the First's feller</b> (Axe) has been invented! <i>Twice as fast logging. Required to build huts.</i>","tech":s:"axe","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404c1dc68f7befa6,"y":n:40450abdf0137d63,"causes":[s:"ev:25",s:"ev:15",],},{"id":n:4045000000000000,"tick":n:4086800000000000,"day":n:403f000000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Ask the First</b> raised logs against each other into a shelter — <b>Ask the First's shelter</b> (Hut) has been invented! <i>Shelter and warmth at night. Three huts close together become a village.</i>","tech":s:"hut","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404c1dc68f7befa6,"y":n:40450abdf0137d63,"causes":[s:"ev:41",],},{"id":n:4045800000000000,"tick":n:4087a80000000000,"day":n:4040000000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Embla</b> learned which leaves ease pain and close a wound — <b>Embla's herb-lore</b> (Medicine) has been invented! <i>Death held off a while — the healer becomes needed.</i>","tech":s:"medicine","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404d28bcea777eb5,"y":n:40460b7aa647580a,"causes":[],},{"id":n:4046000000000000,"tick":n:4088100000000000,"day":n:4040800000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Embla</b> noticed that struck stone breaks into sharp shards. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"sharpShards","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404b6d5062aceac0,"y":n:4045a5bb9cf6b97b,},{"id":n:4046800000000000,"tick":n:4089400000000000,"day":n:4041000000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Torv</b> and <b>Embla</b> have had a child, <b>Sten</b> — generation 2. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4018000000000000,"x":n:404bfa2de0272954,"y":n:4044d953bec35d60,"causes":[s:"agent:4",s:"agent:3",],},{"id":n:4047000000000000,"tick":n:408a200000000000,"day":n:4042000000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4047800000000000,"tick":n:408ac00000000000,"day":n:4042000000000000,"year":n:4018000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Liv</b> taught <b>Torv</b> the secret of Ask the First's javelin. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"spear",},{"id":n:4048000000000000,"tick":n:408b000000000000,"day":n:4042800000000000,"year":n:401c000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4048800000000000,"tick":n:408ea00000000000,"day":n:4045000000000000,"year":n:401c000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4049000000000000,"tick":n:408f980000000000,"day":n:4045800000000000,"year":n:4020000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Torv</b> noticed that spilled seeds sprout where they fall. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"seedsSprout","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404ba2f7d81b4ce2,"y":n:40458ef7e88b5be9,},{"id":n:4049800000000000,"tick":n:408fe80000000000,"day":n:4045800000000000,"year":n:4020000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Embla</b> noticed that fish gather in the shallows. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"fishGather","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404bb206070823da,"y":n:404596815be7cd11,},{"id":n:404a000000000000,"tick":n:4090000000000000,"day":n:4045800000000000,"year":n:4020000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask the First</b> taught <b>Embla</b> the secret of Ask the First's feller. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"axe",},{"id":n:404a800000000000,"tick":n:4090d80000000000,"day":n:4047000000000000,"year":n:4020000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask the First</b> taught <b>Liv</b> the secret of Ask the First's feller. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"axe",},{"id":n:404b000000000000,"tick":n:4091900000000000,"day":n:4048000000000000,"year":n:4020000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:404b800000000000,"tick":n:4092c40000000000,"day":n:4049800000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🏹 <b>Ask the First</b> bent a young branch with a cord and felt it fight back — <b>Ask the First's birchbow</b> (Bow) has been invented! <i>The hunt no longer needs closeness. Deer fall at a distance.</i>","tech":s:"bow","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404c2fed2e38321f,"y":n:4044c7beda32f311,"causes":[s:"ev:39",s:"ev:15",],},{"id":n:404c000000000000,"tick":n:4093300000000000,"day":n:404a000000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🛞 <b>Embla</b> watched a log roll and understood something great — <b>Embla's roller</b> (The Wheel) has been invented! <i>The foundation of mills, carts — and everything that spins.</i>","tech":s:"wheel","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404cea625c2acff0,"y":n:40471d9aa9009c23,"causes":[s:"ev:41",],},{"id":n:404c800000000000,"tick":n:4093440000000000,"day":n:404a000000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask the First</b> taught <b>Liv</b> the secret of Embla's blaze. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"fire",},{"id":n:404d000000000000,"tick":n:4093a80000000000,"day":n:404a800000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Torv</b> starved to death. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4010000000000000,"x":n:404d902f1f5de88d,"y":n:40431c271f0d7c85,"cause":s:"starvation","causes":[s:"cause:starvation",],},{"id":n:404d800000000000,"tick":n:4093d00000000000,"day":n:404b000000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:404e000000000000,"tick":n:40942c0000000000,"day":n:404b800000000000,"year":n:4022000000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Embla</b> built a hut.","x":n:404d95c9c05fa096,"y":n:404749db5fe1dfc9,},{"id":n:404e800000000000,"tick":n:4094400000000000,"day":n:404b800000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:404f000000000000,"tick":n:4094840000000000,"day":n:404b800000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🏺 <b>Embla</b> placed shaped clay in the fire and found it hard as stone — <b>Embla's jar</b> (Pottery) has been invented! <i>Food can be stored — hunger bites less.</i>","tech":s:"pottery","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404d57d71ea00ae1,"y":n:40478589a9a930e6,"causes":[s:"ev:7",],},{"id":n:404f800000000000,"tick":n:4094ac0000000000,"day":n:404c000000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Embla</b> let a twisted line sink where the fish gather — <b>Embla's the net</b> (Fishing) has been invented! <i>The water becomes a larder — food even when the land gives little.</i>","tech":s:"fishing","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404db82be3cf7e8f,"y":n:4047465c4fc3588e,"causes":[s:"ev:15",],},{"id":n:4050000000000000,"tick":n:4094d40000000000,"day":n:404c000000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask the First</b> taught <b>Liv</b> the secret of Ask the First's shelter. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"hut",},{"id":n:4050400000000000,"tick":n:4094e40000000000,"day":n:404c000000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Sten</b> the secret of Embla's blaze. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"fire",},{"id":n:4050800000000000,"tick":n:4096100000000000,"day":n:404e000000000000,"year":n:4024000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4050c00000000000,"tick":n:4097440000000000,"day":n:404f800000000000,"year":n:4026000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask the First</b> taught <b>Sten</b> the secret of Ask the First's javelin. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"spear",},{"id":n:4051000000000000,"tick":n:4097ac0000000000,"day":n:4050000000000000,"year":n:4026000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Ask the First</b> the secret of Embla's jar. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"pottery",},{"id":n:4051400000000000,"tick":n:4098480000000000,"day":n:4050800000000000,"year":n:4026000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Sten</b> the secret of Embla's star-count. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"calendar",},{"id":n:4051800000000000,"tick":n:4098500000000000,"day":n:4050800000000000,"year":n:4026000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4051c00000000000,"tick":n:4098c00000000000,"day":n:4050c00000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4052000000000000,"tick":n:4099180000000000,"day":n:4051000000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🧱 <b>Ask the First</b> built a stone chamber that gathered the heat of the fire — <b>Ask the First's hearth</b> (Kiln) has been invented! <i>Heat enough to melt what hides in ore and sand.</i>","tech":s:"kiln","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404c2837fdad196b,"y":n:40452ae0298b842b,"causes":[s:"ev:7",s:"ev:62",],},{"id":n:4052400000000000,"tick":n:4099340000000000,"day":n:4051000000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"📜 <b>Ask the First</b> carved signs into clay so knowledge could outlive its owner — <b>Ask the First's script</b> (Writing) has been invented! <i>Knowledge spreads to all — and to generations to come.</i>","tech":s:"writing","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404c2837fdad196b,"y":n:40452ae0298b842b,"causes":[s:"ev:62",],},{"id":n:4052800000000000,"tick":n:4099c40000000000,"day":n:4051400000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Ask the First the Spearmaker</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,},{"id":n:4052c00000000000,"tick":n:4099cc0000000000,"day":n:4051800000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🧠 <b>Ask the First</b> asked not what the world is but why, and wrote it down — <b>Ask the First's the argument</b> (Philosophy) has been invented! <i>Reasoned thought — the seed of law, science and doubt.</i>","tech":s:"philosophy","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404be5623b3ff161,"y":n:4045139def7b3a40,"causes":[s:"ev:73",],},{"id":n:4053000000000000,"tick":n:4099e80000000000,"day":n:4051800000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Ask the First</b> tried something with  — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,},{"id":n:4053400000000000,"tick":n:409a240000000000,"day":n:4051800000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"⚖️ <b>Ask the First</b> wrote the customs down so all were judged by one measure — <b>Ask the First's written law</b> (Law) has been invented! <i>Custom hardened into law — the institution of justice.</i>","tech":s:"law","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404c1cce85f4fd7e,"y":n:404503ee5440c00b,"causes":[s:"ev:73",s:"ev:22",],},{"id":n:4053800000000000,"tick":n:409a400000000000,"day":n:4051c00000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🏫 <b>Ask the First</b> set the knowing to teach the young in one place — <b>Ask the First's teaching</b> (School) has been invented! <i>Knowledge taught on purpose — learning outlives the teacher.</i>","tech":s:"school","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404c1cce85f4fd7e,"y":n:404503ee5440c00b,"causes":[s:"ev:73",s:"ev:22",],},{"id":n:4053c00000000000,"tick":n:409a5c0000000000,"day":n:4051c00000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"📚 <b>Ask the First</b> gathered writings and studied them as a life's work — <b>Ask the First's the scholar</b> (Scholarship) has been invented! <i>Knowledge accumulated and compared — the scholar emerges.</i>","tech":s:"scholarship","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404c1cce85f4fd7e,"y":n:404503ee5440c00b,"causes":[s:"ev:75",s:"ev:78",],},{"id":n:4054000000000000,"tick":n:409a900000000000,"day":n:4052000000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4054400000000000,"tick":n:409ae00000000000,"day":n:4052000000000000,"year":n:4028000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Sten</b> the secret of Embla's braid. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"rope",},{"id":n:4054800000000000,"tick":n:409b000000000000,"day":n:4052400000000000,"year":n:402a000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4054c00000000000,"tick":n:409be80000000000,"day":n:4052c00000000000,"year":n:402a000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask the First</b> taught <b>Liv</b> the secret of Embla's jar. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"pottery",},{"id":n:4055000000000000,"tick":n:409cd00000000000,"day":n:4053800000000000,"year":n:402a000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4055400000000000,"tick":n:409cd40000000000,"day":n:4053800000000000,"year":n:402a000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Liv</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:404bbaeb7b5fce16,"y":n:4045923bca51d11b,},{"id":n:4055800000000000,"tick":n:409d0c0000000000,"day":n:4053800000000000,"year":n:402a000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Sten</b> the secret of Embla's the song. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"song",},{"id":n:4055c00000000000,"tick":n:409d400000000000,"day":n:4053c00000000000,"year":n:402c000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4056000000000000,"tick":n:409f100000000000,"day":n:4055000000000000,"year":n:402c000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4056400000000000,"tick":n:40a01a0000000000,"day":n:4055c00000000000,"year":n:402e000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Ask the First</b> pressed spilled seeds into turned soil and waited — <b>Ask the First's the first field</b> (Farming) has been invented! <i>Food that returns every year. The village roots itself.</i>","tech":s:"farming","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404bd49d57686b51,"y":n:404532d5a5dd4b9a,"causes":[s:"ev:62",],},{"id":n:4056800000000000,"tick":n:40a0480000000000,"day":n:4056000000000000,"year":n:402e000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask the First</b> taught <b>Liv</b> the secret of Ask the First's the scholar. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"scholarship",},{"id":n:4056c00000000000,"tick":n:40a0a80000000000,"day":n:4056800000000000,"year":n:402e000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4057000000000000,"tick":n:40a0d00000000000,"day":n:4056800000000000,"year":n:402e000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 Under the Sky-Wheel, the people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404c377571d760bf,"y":n:40453def6e150ea1,},{"id":n:4057400000000000,"tick":n:40a0d40000000000,"day":n:4056c00000000000,"year":n:402e000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Liv</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:4014000000000000,},{"id":n:4057800000000000,"tick":n:40a1700000000000,"day":n:4057800000000000,"year":n:4030000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Sten</b> taught <b>Ask the First</b> the secret of Embla's the song. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"song",},{"id":n:4057c00000000000,"tick":n:40a1c80000000000,"day":n:4058000000000000,"year":n:4030000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4058000000000000,"tick":n:40a1ec0000000000,"day":n:4058000000000000,"year":n:4030000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Liv</b> the secret of Embla's warp-craft. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"weaving",},{"id":n:4058400000000000,"tick":n:40a2360000000000,"day":n:4058800000000000,"year":n:4031000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🎼 <b>Ask the First</b> wrote music down so a song could outlive its singer — <b>Ask the First's written music</b> (Composition) has been invented! <i>Music made lasting and grand — the composer, the choir, the hall.</i>","tech":s:"composition","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404ca69a60766e2a,"y":n:4045f5575d617658,"causes":[s:"ev:30",s:"ev:73",],},{"id":n:4058800000000000,"tick":n:40a27a0000000000,"day":n:4058c00000000000,"year":n:4031000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask the First</b> taught <b>Embla</b> the secret of Ask the First's the first field. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"farming",},{"id":n:4058c00000000000,"tick":n:40a2b40000000000,"day":n:4059400000000000,"year":n:4031000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Embla</b> and <b>Ask the First</b> have had a child, <b>Ylva</b> — generation 2. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:401c000000000000,"x":n:404d2c8d395c065c,"y":n:4045ea8b354a62bc,"causes":[s:"agent:3",s:"agent:1",],},{"id":n:4059000000000000,"tick":n:40a2de0000000000,"day":n:4059400000000000,"year":n:4031000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🧱 <b>Ask the First</b> fired shaped clay into blocks that stack true — <b>Ask the First's block</b> (Brick) has been invented! <i>Walls that outlast weather — the start of building.</i>","tech":s:"brick","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404d23216e35bca9,"y":n:4045eedf129fbfa9,"causes":[s:"ev:62",s:"ev:72",],},{"id":n:4059400000000000,"tick":n:40a2e80000000000,"day":n:4059800000000000,"year":n:4031000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4059800000000000,"tick":n:40a2ee0000000000,"day":n:4059800000000000,"year":n:4031000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🕳️ <b>Ask the First</b> lined a deep pit with stone to hold clean water — <b>Ask the First's stone well</b> (Well) has been invented! <i>Water without walking to the river — a village can grow inland.</i>","tech":s:"well","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404d23216e35bca9,"y":n:4045eedf129fbfa9,"causes":[s:"ev:100",],},{"id":n:4059c00000000000,"tick":n:40a2f00000000000,"day":n:4059800000000000,"year":n:4031000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Sten</b> the secret of Ask the First's the first field. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"farming",},{"id":n:405a000000000000,"tick":n:40a3200000000000,"day":n:4059c00000000000,"year":n:4032000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:405a400000000000,"tick":n:40a3240000000000,"day":n:4059c00000000000,"year":n:4032000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"⚪ <b>Liv</b> smelted a pale metal too soft to be worth much alone — <b>Liv's the pale metal</b> (Tin) has been invented! <i>Useless alone — everything when married to copper.</i>","tech":s:"tin","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:40512ae8cd4be4a2,"y":n:404ce4e84d882c95,"causes":[s:"ev:72",],},{"id":n:405a800000000000,"tick":n:40a3260000000000,"day":n:4059c00000000000,"year":n:4032000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Sten</b> taught <b>Ylva</b> the secret of Ask the First's javelin. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"spear",},{"id":n:405ac00000000000,"tick":n:40a3300000000000,"day":n:4059c00000000000,"year":n:4032000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Sten</b> has turned the soil — the valley's first field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:4018000000000000,"x":n:404b000000000000,"y":n:4045800000000000,},{"id":n:405b000000000000,"tick":n:40a3400000000000,"day":n:4059c00000000000,"year":n:4032000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 Under the Sky-Wheel, the people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:40504563692630f0,"y":n:404a95a38124bbdc,},{"id":n:405b400000000000,"tick":n:40a3aa0000000000,"day":n:405a800000000000,"year":n:4032000000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Liv</b> built a hut.","x":n:404d8b4c5a67c500,"y":n:4047a891de12208a,},{"id":n:405b800000000000,"tick":n:40a4080000000000,"day":n:405b000000000000,"year":n:4032000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:405bc00000000000,"tick":n:40a43a0000000000,"day":n:405b400000000000,"year":n:4032000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Sten</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:4018000000000000,"x":n:404bb550b27c8b12,"y":n:4045e9bde89a31f2,},{"id":n:405c000000000000,"tick":n:40a4700000000000,"day":n:405b800000000000,"year":n:4033000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Liv</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:404b000000000000,"y":n:4049000000000000,},{"id":n:405c400000000000,"tick":n:40a4940000000000,"day":n:405bc00000000000,"year":n:4033000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Liv</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4014000000000000,},{"id":n:405c800000000000,"tick":n:40a4980000000000,"day":n:405bc00000000000,"year":n:4033000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask the First</b> taught <b>Sten</b> the secret of Ask the First's written music. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"composition",},{"id":n:405cc00000000000,"tick":n:40a4e00000000000,"day":n:405c000000000000,"year":n:4033000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Liv</b> tried something with wood and clay — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4014000000000000,},{"id":n:405d000000000000,"tick":n:40a5240000000000,"day":n:405c800000000000,"year":n:4033000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🏚️ <b>Liv</b> built a dry raised store so the harvest kept till spring — <b>Liv's silo</b> (Granary) has been invented! <i>Surplus survives winter — the first true wealth.</i>","tech":s:"granary","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:404bc45608517859,"y":n:404703f23a759c80,"causes":[s:"ev:89",s:"ev:62",],},{"id":n:405d400000000000,"tick":n:40a5280000000000,"day":n:405c800000000000,"year":n:4033000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:405d800000000000,"tick":n:40a5600000000000,"day":n:405cc00000000000,"year":n:4034000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"⛵ <b>Liv</b> stretched cloth on a hull and let the wind do the work — <b>Liv's the boat</b> (Sailing) has been invented! <i>Rivers and coasts become roads — trade and migration by water.</i>","tech":s:"sailing","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:404c6849fd4f49e5,"y":n:4047b9c67e1fd1d2,"causes":[s:"ev:17",s:"ev:41",],},{"id":n:405dc00000000000,"tick":n:40a6480000000000,"day":n:405e000000000000,"year":n:4034000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:405e000000000000,"tick":n:40a6800000000000,"day":n:405e400000000000,"year":n:4035000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:405e400000000000,"tick":n:40a6840000000000,"day":n:405e400000000000,"year":n:4035000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Embla</b> and <b>Liv</b> have had a child, <b>Bjorn</b> — generation 3. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4020000000000000,"x":n:404ce078ea2db133,"y":n:4045cbbcb9d66ec0,"causes":[s:"agent:3",s:"agent:5",],},{"id":n:405e800000000000,"tick":n:40a6940000000000,"day":n:405e400000000000,"year":n:4035000000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Liv</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:404b804239b323f4,"y":n:4046082eb10577b8,},{"id":n:405ec00000000000,"tick":n:40a7680000000000,"day":n:405f800000000000,"year":n:4035000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:405f000000000000,"tick":n:40a7720000000000,"day":n:405f800000000000,"year":n:4035000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask the First</b> taught <b>Bjorn</b> the secret of Ask the First's knife. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"sharp",},{"id":n:405f400000000000,"tick":n:40a8360000000000,"day":n:4060400000000000,"year":n:4036000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Liv</b> noticed that stones leant just so hold up more than their own weight. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"archStands","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:404b740178c34a02,"y":n:404374ab39b1615f,},{"id":n:405f800000000000,"tick":n:40a8880000000000,"day":n:4060800000000000,"year":n:4036000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:405fc00000000000,"tick":n:40a8b00000000000,"day":n:4060800000000000,"year":n:4036000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Sten</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4018000000000000,},{"id":n:4060000000000000,"tick":n:40a8c00000000000,"day":n:4060a00000000000,"year":n:4037000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4060200000000000,"tick":n:40a9300000000000,"day":n:4060e00000000000,"year":n:4037000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🌾 <b>Sten</b> let the wheel drive stones that ground grain — <b>Sten's crusher</b> (Mill) has been invented! <i>The village can process food — famine recedes.</i>","tech":s:"mill","agent":n:4018000000000000,"x":n:404d0a243bddf1cb,"y":n:4041608eb0060164,"causes":[s:"ev:56",],},{"id":n:4060400000000000,"tick":n:40a94a0000000000,"day":n:4061000000000000,"year":n:4037000000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Sten</b> built a hut.","x":n:404d8f03748a24fe,"y":n:4040aa254a093497,},{"id":n:4060600000000000,"tick":n:40a9a80000000000,"day":n:4061400000000000,"year":n:4037000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ A hard winter grips the world. The old will remember it; not all the young will see spring.",},{"id":n:4060800000000000,"tick":n:40aab20000000000,"day":n:4061e00000000000,"year":n:4038000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🧱 <b>Liv</b> dressed and fitted stone so it stood without mortar — <b>Liv's stonecraft</b> (Masonry) has been invented! <i>Buildings that outlive their builders — the seed of monuments.</i>","tech":s:"masonry","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:404c6f9656326b17,"y":n:40424f6ca765f916,"causes":[s:"ev:100",],},{"id":n:4060a00000000000,"tick":n:40aac80000000000,"day":n:4062000000000000,"year":n:4038000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4060c00000000000,"tick":n:40aaf20000000000,"day":n:4062000000000000,"year":n:4038000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Liv</b> and <b>Sten</b> have had a child, <b>Saga</b> — generation 3. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4022000000000000,"x":n:404c52acf00028ff,"y":n:4042758ef8d47152,"causes":[s:"agent:5",s:"agent:6",],},{"id":n:4060e00000000000,"tick":n:40ab040000000000,"day":n:4062200000000000,"year":n:4039000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🛤️ <b>Liv</b> laid stone in a bed so carts ran true in any weather — <b>Liv's the highway</b> (Road) has been invented! <i>Villages bound together — trade, news and armies move.</i>","tech":s:"road","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:404c0c574b8b8f65,"y":n:4042ab20bba3d7b9,"causes":[s:"ev:56",s:"ev:132",],},{"id":n:4061000000000000,"tick":n:40ab240000000000,"day":n:4062400000000000,"year":n:4039000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Bjorn</b> the secret of Ask the First's number. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"numbers",},{"id":n:4061200000000000,"tick":n:40ab3c0000000000,"day":n:4062400000000000,"year":n:4039000000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Embla the Firebringer</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:404c526bedc05d86,"y":n:4045db77e32775ed,},{"id":n:4061400000000000,"tick":n:40ab580000000000,"day":n:4062600000000000,"year":n:4039000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask the First</b> taught <b>Embla</b> the secret of Ask the First's block. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"brick",},{"id":n:4061600000000000,"tick":n:40ab580000000000,"day":n:4062600000000000,"year":n:4039000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Ask the First</b> and <b>Embla</b> have had a child, <b>Rune</b> — generation 2. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4024000000000000,"x":n:404ce75885a023a1,"y":n:4045e26fa50961ee,"causes":[s:"agent:1",s:"agent:3",],},{"id":n:4061800000000000,"tick":n:40abe20000000000,"day":n:4062a00000000000,"year":n:4039000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🏛️ <b>Liv</b> raised the arch, and space opened under stone — <b>Liv's great halls</b> (Architecture) has been invented! <i>Temples, halls and towers — the shape of a civilization made visible.</i>","tech":s:"architecture","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:404b19d19126aabc,"y":n:4042bfc501e73211,"causes":[s:"ev:132",],},{"id":n:4061a00000000000,"tick":n:40abe80000000000,"day":n:4062c00000000000,"year":n:4039000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4061c00000000000,"tick":n:40ac6c0000000000,"day":n:4063000000000000,"year":n:403a000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🌉 <b>Liv</b> carried water across the valley on arches of stone — <b>Liv's water-bridge</b> (Aqueduct) has been invented! <i>Cities freed from the river — population without limit of the well.</i>","tech":s:"aqueduct","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:404c61bb55ff85ff,"y":n:403cede7c4f458ed,"causes":[s:"ev:140",s:"ev:102",],},{"id":n:4061e00000000000,"tick":n:40acee0000000000,"day":n:4063600000000000,"year":n:403a000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🌬️ <b>Liv</b> set great sails to catch the wind and turn the stones — <b>Liv's tower-mill</b> (Windmill) has been invented! <i>Grinding and pumping without river or muscle.</i>","tech":s:"windmill","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:404c42e3c2b9f153,"y":n:403c78fe50dc538a,"causes":[s:"ev:129",s:"ev:140",],},{"id":n:4062000000000000,"tick":n:40ad080000000000,"day":n:4063800000000000,"year":n:403a000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4062200000000000,"tick":n:40ad2e0000000000,"day":n:4063800000000000,"year":n:403a000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Liv</b> taught <b>Saga</b> the secret of Embla's braid. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"rope",},{"id":n:4062400000000000,"tick":n:40ad400000000000,"day":n:4063a00000000000,"year":n:403b000000000000,"type":s:"quirk","txt":s:"🙂 <b>Ask the First</b> carries a stick everywhere. It is never used for anything. Once begun, never stopped.","agent":n:3ff0000000000000,"x":n:404d199521c3eea4,"y":n:4045fa245c3e82a8,},{"id":n:4062600000000000,"tick":n:40ad780000000000,"day":n:4063c00000000000,"year":n:403b000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Sten</b> tried something with wood and stone — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4018000000000000,},{"id":n:4062800000000000,"tick":n:40ad960000000000,"day":n:4063e00000000000,"year":n:403b000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ask the First</b> taught <b>Embla</b> the secret of Liv's the boat. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"sailing",},{"id":n:4062a00000000000,"tick":n:40ad960000000000,"day":n:4063e00000000000,"year":n:403b000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Embla the Firebringer</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4008000000000000,},{"id":n:4062c00000000000,"tick":n:40ae280000000000,"day":n:4064400000000000,"year":n:403b000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4062e00000000000,"tick":n:40ae320000000000,"day":n:4064400000000000,"year":n:403b000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Liv</b> taught <b>Saga</b> the secret of Ask the First's birchbow. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"bow",},{"id":n:4063000000000000,"tick":n:40ae840000000000,"day":n:4064800000000000,"year":n:403c000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Sten</b> taught <b>Bjorn</b> the secret of Embla's the net. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"fishing",},{"id":n:4063200000000000,"tick":n:40aea00000000000,"day":n:4064800000000000,"year":n:403c000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Rune</b> the secret of Embla's herb-lore. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"medicine",},{"id":n:4063400000000000,"tick":n:40af3e0000000000,"day":n:4064e00000000000,"year":n:403c000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Liv</b> taught <b>Saga</b> the secret of Embla's star-count. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"calendar",},{"id":n:4063600000000000,"tick":n:40af480000000000,"day":n:4065000000000000,"year":n:403c000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4063800000000000,"tick":n:40afb60000000000,"day":n:4065400000000000,"year":n:403d000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Ylva</b> the secret of Ask the First's the first field. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"farming",},{"id":n:4063a00000000000,"tick":n:40afca0000000000,"day":n:4065400000000000,"year":n:403d000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"⛩️ <b>Sten</b> raised a house for the sacred and gathered the faithful in it — <b>Sten's the shrine-hall</b> (Temple) has been invented! <i>Belief given a home and a keeper — organized religion.</i>","tech":s:"temple","agent":n:4018000000000000,"x":n:404c5c0f998d5458,"y":n:4042d5adc634ca73,"causes":[s:"ev:132",],},{"id":n:4063c00000000000,"tick":n:40b02e0000000000,"day":n:4065a00000000000,"year":n:403d000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Liv</b> taught <b>Saga</b> the secret of Embla's blaze. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"fire",},{"id":n:4063e00000000000,"tick":n:40b0340000000000,"day":n:4065c00000000000,"year":n:403d000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4064000000000000,"tick":n:40b0500000000000,"day":n:4065e00000000000,"year":n:403e000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4064200000000000,"tick":n:40b05b0000000000,"day":n:4065e00000000000,"year":n:403e000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Bjorn</b> taught <b>Rune</b> the secret of Embla's braid. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"rope",},{"id":n:4064400000000000,"tick":n:40b0650000000000,"day":n:4066000000000000,"year":n:403e000000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Ask the First</b> built a hut.","x":n:404d260a069298d4,"y":n:4045cd0b8cceb3a3,},{"id":n:4064600000000000,"tick":n:40b0650000000000,"day":n:4066000000000000,"year":n:403e000000000000,"type":s:"village","txt":s:"🏘️ Three huts have become more — <b>Askvik</b> has been founded! A village born of nothing but cooperation.","village":s:"Askvik","x":n:404d260a069298d4,"y":n:4045cd0b8cceb3a3,"causes":[s:"agent:1",],},{"id":n:4064800000000000,"tick":n:40b0a80000000000,"day":n:4066400000000000,"year":n:403e000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Ylva</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:401c000000000000,"x":n:404d1c18da82e3fc,"y":n:404621be54ee76e2,},{"id":n:4064a00000000000,"tick":n:40b0c40000000000,"day":n:4066800000000000,"year":n:403e000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4064c00000000000,"tick":n:40b0e00000000000,"day":n:4066a00000000000,"year":n:403f000000000000,"type":s:"tradition","txt":s:"🏘️ In Askvik, believing the sky-wheel turns with the seasons and can be read like tracks in snow is now simply what one does. <b>the Sky-Wheel</b> has become a tradition.","custom":s:"c1","x":n:404d260a069298d4,"y":n:4045cd0b8cceb3a3,},{"id":n:4064e00000000000,"tick":n:40b0e00000000000,"day":n:4066a00000000000,"year":n:403f000000000000,"type":s:"tradition","txt":s:"🏘️ In Askvik, believing the world repeats and can be understood is now simply what one does. <b>The Knowing Eye</b> has become a tradition.","custom":s:"c2","x":n:404d260a069298d4,"y":n:4045cd0b8cceb3a3,},{"id":n:4065000000000000,"tick":n:40b0e90000000000,"day":n:4066a00000000000,"year":n:403f000000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Sten</b> tried something with stone — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:4018000000000000,},{"id":n:4065200000000000,"tick":n:40b1420000000000,"day":n:4067200000000000,"year":n:403f000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Embla</b> taught <b>Ylva</b> the secret of Liv's stonecraft. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"masonry",},{"id":n:4065400000000000,"tick":n:40b1540000000000,"day":n:4067400000000000,"year":n:403f000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4065600000000000,"tick":n:40b15d0000000000,"day":n:4067400000000000,"year":n:403f000000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"🎓 <b>Sten</b> joined scholars and students into a lasting house of learning — <b>Sten's the academy</b> (University) has been invented! <i>Learning institutionalized — the engine of every later age.</i>","tech":s:"university","agent":n:4018000000000000,"x":n:404b7d56083fe87e,"y":n:404539ede835b354,"causes":[s:"ev:79",s:"ev:78",],},{"id":n:4065800000000000,"tick":n:40b1780000000000,"day":n:4067600000000000,"year":n:4040000000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Ylva</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:401c000000000000,"x":n:404b000000000000,"y":n:4045000000000000,},{"id":n:4065a00000000000,"tick":n:40b1980000000000,"day":n:4067800000000000,"year":n:4040000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Ylva</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:401c000000000000,},{"id":n:4065c00000000000,"tick":n:40b1ab0000000000,"day":n:4067a00000000000,"year":n:4040000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Ylva</b> noticed that stones grind seed to flour. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"stonesGrind","agent":n:401c000000000000,"x":n:404b9d81dfb5abaa,"y":n:40432818924a4ba2,},{"id":n:4065e00000000000,"tick":n:40b1e40000000000,"day":n:4068000000000000,"year":n:4040000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4066000000000000,"tick":n:40b20c0000000000,"d