 have had a child, <b>Signe</b> — generation 3. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:402e000000000000,"x":n:404d7088325224b4,"y":n:404334446a3144bd,"causes":[s:"agent:7",s:"agent:5",],},{"id":n:4070000000000000,"tick":n:40ba0d0000000000,"day":n:4071700000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Rune</b> taught <b>Halvar</b> the secret of Embla's warp-craft. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"weaving",},{"id":n:4070100000000000,"tick":n:40ba280000000000,"day":n:4071800000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Rune</b> taught <b>Halvar</b> the secret of Embla's jar. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"pottery",},{"id":n:4070200000000000,"tick":n:40ba2d0000000000,"day":n:4071800000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Liv</b> taught <b>Idun</b> the secret of Ask the First's feller. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"axe",},{"id":n:4070300000000000,"tick":n:40ba350000000000,"day":n:4071800000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Saga</b> noticed that fire makes the heavy ore sweat metal. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"oreMelts","agent":n:4022000000000000,"x":n:404baa347759eca9,"y":n:404068805c9ef2d4,},{"id":n:4070400000000000,"tick":n:40ba4e0000000000,"day":n:4071900000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"tech","txt":s:"⚒️ <b>Saga</b> watched gleaming metal run from the glowing ore — <b>Saga's ironcraft</b> (Iron smithing) has been invented! <i>Metal — an entirely new material.</i>","tech":s:"smithing","agent":n:4022000000000000,"x":n:404b040ebb46f349,"y":n:4042add9b38c2834,"causes":[s:"ev:72",],},{"id":n:4070500000000000,"tick":n:40ba4e0000000000,"day":n:4071900000000000,"year":n:4047800000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Saga</b> was known as <b>Saga the Ironhand</b>.","agent":n:4022000000000000,"x":n:404b040ebb46f349,"y":n:4042add9b38c2834,},{"id":n:4070600000000000,"tick":n:40ba510000000000,"day":n:4071900000000000,"year":n:40478000