d380000000000,"day":n:4073800000000000,"year":n:404a000000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Vidar</b> noticed that fish gather in the shallows. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"fishGather","agent":n:4030000000000000,"x":n:404d3b68aa61ecbc,"y":n:40460e467afcda43,},{"id":n:4072c00000000000,"tick":n:40bd400000000000,"day":n:4073900000000000,"year":n:404a800000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4072d00000000000,"tick":n:40bd6b0000000000,"day":n:4073b00000000000,"year":n:404a800000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"📜✨ <b>Kare</b> pressed the pattern of the stars into clay — the first star-marks. Now the sky can be remembered.","agent":n:4028000000000000,},{"id":n:4072e00000000000,"tick":n:40bd900000000000,"day":n:4073c00000000000,"year":n:404a800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Halvar</b> taught <b>Vidar</b> the secret of Liv's great halls. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"architecture",},{"id":n:4072f00000000000,"tick":n:40bda20000000000,"day":n:4073d00000000000,"year":n:404a800000000000,"type":s:"hut","txt":s:"🛖 <b>Kare</b> built a hut.","x":n:404c101ed84cd789,"y":n:403b8499e9b8a2fe,},{"id":n:4073000000000000,"tick":n:40bda20000000000,"day":n:4073d00000000000,"year":n:404a800000000000,"type":s:"epithet","txt":s:"✨ From that day on, <b>Kare</b> was known as <b>Kare the Founder</b>.","agent":n:4028000000000000,"x":n:404c101ed84cd789,"y":n:403b8499e9b8a2fe,},{"id":n:4073100000000000,"tick":n:40bda20000000000,"day":n:4073d00000000000,"year":n:404a800000000000,"type":s:"village","txt":s:"🏘️ Three huts have become more — <b>Karestead</b> has been founded! A village born of nothing but cooperation.","village":s:"Karestead","x":n:404c101ed84cd789,"y":n:403b8499e9b8a2fe,"causes":[s:"agent:12",],},{"id":n:4073200000000000,"tick":n:40bda70000000000,"day":n:4073d00000000000,"year":n:404a800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Saga</b> taught <b>Tuva</b> the secret of Ask the First's script. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"writing",},{"id":n:4073300000000000,"tick":n:40bdb40000000000,"day":n:4073e00000000000,"year":n:404a800000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4073400000000000,"tick":n:40bdb60000000000,"day":n:4073e00000000000,"year":n:404a800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Bjorn</b> taught <b>Alve</b> the secret of Ask the First's feller. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"axe",},{"id":n:4073500000000000,"tick":n:40bdc80000000000,"day":n:4073e00000000000,"year":n:404a800000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"🌌 Under the Sky-Wheel, the people gather in the dark and turn their faces to the stars.","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:404ba69488d0e70c,"y":n:403fc4cc80cd43ad,},{"id":n:4073600000000000,"tick":n:40bdd00000000000,"day":n:4073f00000000000,"year":n:404b000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4073700000000000,"tick":n:40be440000000000,"day":n:4074400000000000,"year":n:404b000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4073800000000000,"tick":n:40be760000000000,"day":n:4074600000000000,"year":n:404b800000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Freja</b> and <b>Rune</b> have had a child, <b>Ronja</b> — generation 4. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4033000000000000,"x":n:404d08217790c7b4,"y":n:4045e6ab4d42fcbf,"causes":[s:"agent:11",s:"agent:10",],},{"id":n:4073900000000000,"tick":n:40be760000000000,"day":n:4074600000000000,"year":n:404b800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ronja</b> taught <b>Vidar</b> the secret of Liv's the boat. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"sailing",},{"id":n:4073a00000000000,"tick":n:40bea10000000000,"day":n:4074700000000000,"year":n:404b800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Liv</b> taught <b>Bjorn</b> the secret of Sten's the academy. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"university",},{"id":n:4073b00000000000,"tick":n:40bed40000000000,"day":n:4074a00000000000,"year":n:404b800000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4073c00000000000,"tick":n:40bef00000000000,"day":n:4074b00000000000,"year":n:404c000000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Rune</b> set out for Karestead. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:4024000000000000,"x":n:404d0e3f76990fdf,"y":n:404639fd28bb8a94,},{"id":n:4073d00000000000,"tick":n:40befb0000000000,"day":n:4074b00000000000,"year":n:404c000000000000,"type":s:"hunt","txt":s:"🎣 <b>Kare the Founder</b> pulled silver from the water.","agent":n:4028000000000000,"x":n:40515c5437a843ae,"y":n:40451d0b95017a8c,},{"id":n:4073e00000000000,"tick":n:40bf0c0000000000,"day":n:4074c00000000000,"year":n:404c000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Ronja</b> taught <b>Alve</b> the secret of Ask the First's script. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"writing",},{"id":n:4073f00000000000,"tick":n:40bf1b0000000000,"day":n:4074d00000000000,"year":n:404c000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Idun</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:402a000000000000,"x":n:4051d54d5c92bfe2,"y":n:4044cda16263eb87,},{"id":n:4074000000000000,"tick":n:40bf260000000000,"day":n:4074d00000000000,"year":n:404c000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Alve</b> taught <b>Ronja</b> the secret of Ask the First's knife. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"sharp",},{"id":n:4074100000000000,"tick":n:40bf610000000000,"day":n:4074f00000000000,"year":n:404c000000000000,"type":s:"custom","txt":s:"🌿 <b>Bjorn</b> began laying flowers on the fallen prey — no one told them to. Others may follow. <i>(Laying flowers on the fallen prey)</i>","custom":s:"c3","agent":n:4020000000000000,"x":n:404acbb97cc9b32a,"y":n:4046fd150a85923e,"label":s:"A CUSTOM APPEARS",},{"id":n:4074200000000000,"tick":n:40bf640000000000,"day":n:4075000000000000,"year":n:404c000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4074300000000000,"tick":n:40bf800000000000,"day":n:4075100000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"journey","txt":s:"🚶 <b>Rune</b> set out for Karestead. Ideas travel on foot.","agent":n:4024000000000000,"x":n:404d3e0e6ec9da4f,"y":n:4045ec4c3d11df9e,},{"id":n:4074400000000000,"tick":n:40bfaf0000000000,"day":n:4075300000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Vidar</b> taught <b>Alve</b> the secret of Ask the First's script. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"writing",},{"id":n:4074500000000000,"tick":n:40bfb60000000000,"day":n:4075300000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Bjorn</b> taught <b>Ronja</b> the secret of Embla's braid. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"rope",},{"id":n:4074600000000000,"tick":n:40bff40000000000,"day":n:4075600000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Liv</b> died of old age at 56. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4014000000000000,"x":n:404be483b58cfea4,"y":n:4044c2d778515552,"cause":s:"age","causes":[s:"cause:age",],},{"id":n:4074700000000000,"tick":n:40bff40000000000,"day":n:4075600000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Rune</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:4074800000000000,"tick":n:40bff40000000000,"day":n:4075600000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4074900000000000,"tick":n:40bff60000000000,"day":n:4075600000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Vidar</b> taught <b>Rune</b> the secret of Sten's the shrine-hall. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"temple",},{"id":n:4074a00000000000,"tick":n:40c0000000000000,"day":n:4075600000000000,"year":n:404c800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Halvar</b> taught <b>Alve</b> the secret of Ask the First's script. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"writing",},{"id":n:4074b00000000000,"tick":n:40c0080000000000,"day":n:4075700000000000,"year":n:404d000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"🌸 Spring returns. The survivors count each other, and begin again.",},{"id":n:4074c00000000000,"tick":n:40c0210000000000,"day":n:4075900000000000,"year":n:404d000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Alve</b> taught <b>Ronja</b> the secret of Embla's star-count. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"calendar",},{"id":n:4074d00000000000,"tick":n:40c0340000000000,"day":n:4075a00000000000,"year":n:404d000000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Halvar</b> lay awake in the dark and watched the lights that do not fall.","agent":n:402c000000000000,"x":n:404d0042b5622c8b,"y":n:4046039d9e6b6ae7,},{"id":n:4074e00000000000,"tick":n:40c0420000000000,"day":n:4075c00000000000,"year":n:404d000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ A hard winter grips the world. The old will remember it; not all the young will see spring.",},{"id":n:4074f00000000000,"tick":n:40c04a0000000000,"day":n:4075c00000000000,"year":n:404d000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Saga</b> taught <b>Kare</b> the secret of Sten's the shrine-hall. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"temple",},{"id":n:4075000000000000,"tick":n:40c04f0000000000,"day":n:4075d00000000000,"year":n:404d000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Rune</b> taught <b>Vidar</b> the secret of Liv's the highway. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"road",},{"id":n:4075100000000000,"tick":n:40c0508000000000,"day":n:4075d00000000000,"year":n:404d800000000000,"type":s:"death","txt":s:"<b>Embla the Firebringer</b> died of old age at 81. Much knowledge died with them — unless someone learned in time.","agent":n:4008000000000000,"x":n:405005937a1c32c0,"y":n:4047e0c31e763967,"cause":s:"age","causes":[s:"cause:age",],},{"id":n:4075200000000000,"tick":n:40c0508000000000,"day":n:4075d00000000000,"year":n:404d800000000000,"type":s:"moved","txt":s:"<b>Freja</b> moved into an abandoned hut.",},{"id":n:4075300000000000,"tick":n:40c0540000000000,"day":n:4075d00000000000,"year":n:404d800000000000,"type":s:"field","txt":s:"🌱 <b>Alve</b> has turned the soil — a new field lies open to the sky.","agent":n:4032000000000000,"x":n:404a800000000000,"y":n:4045000000000000,},{"id":n:4075400000000000,"tick":n:40c0648000000000,"day":n:4075e00000000000,"year":n:404d800000000000,"type":s:"star","txt":s:"✨ <b>Halvar</b> watches the stars again, night after night. Something is taking shape.","agent":n:402c000000000000,},{"id":n:4075500000000000,"tick":n:40c0698000000000,"day":n:4075f00000000000,"year":n:404d800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Rune</b> taught <b>Vidar</b> the secret of Bjorn's cave-marks. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"painting",},{"id":n:4075600000000000,"tick":n:40c06a8000000000,"day":n:4075f00000000000,"year":n:404d800000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Ylva</b> noticed that iron worked long in a hotter fire holds a keener edge. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"steelKeen","agent":n:401c000000000000,"x":n:40530bb5e91820d1,"y":n:404ae9edce27992b,},{"id":n:4075700000000000,"tick":n:40c0720000000000,"day":n:4076000000000000,"year":n:404d800000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Halvar</b> taught <b>Alve</b> the secret of Embla's warp-craft. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"weaving",},{"id":n:4075800000000000,"tick":n:40c0770000000000,"day":n:4076000000000000,"year":n:404d800000000000,"type":s:"failed","txt":s:"<b>Idun</b> tried something with tin — and failed. But failure teaches.","agent":n:402a000000000000,},{"id":n:4075900000000000,"tick":n:40c07d0000000000,"day":n:4076100000000000,"year":n:404d800000000000,"type":s:"observed","txt":s:"👁️ <b>Idun</b> noticed that rubbing wood makes heat. An idea begins to form.","obs":s:"frictionHeat","agent":n:402a000000000000,"x":n:404f441f146bcbc9,"y":n:404984dfd2bdf35e,},{"id":n:4075a00000000000,"tick":n:40c08a0000000000,"day":n:4076200000000000,"year":n:404d800000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},{"id":n:4075b00000000000,"tick":n:40c0b38000000000,"day":n:4076500000000000,"year":n:404e000000000000,"type":s:"child","txt":s:"👶 <b>Bjorn</b> and <b>Freja</b> have had a child, <b>Sixten</b> — generation 4. They inherit traits from both.","agent":n:4034000000000000,"x":n:404c2fdd2f9066d4,"y":n:4044c0e712ce67f7,"causes":[s:"agent:8",s:"agent:11",],},{"id":n:4075c00000000000,"tick":n:40c0bc8000000000,"day":n:4076600000000000,"year":n:404e000000000000,"type":s:"taught","txt":s:"<b>Vidar</b> taught <b>Ronja</b> the secret of Liv's the highway. The knowledge spreads.","tech":s:"road",},{"id":n:4075d00000000000,"tick":n:40c0d20000000000,"day":n:4076800000000000,"year":n:404e000000000000,"type":s:"season","txt":s:"❄️ Winter closes over the world. The stores will decide who sees spring.",},],"dna":{"seed":n:40b0920000000000,"years":n:404e800000000000,"dna":{"Curious":n:4040800000000000,"Social":n:4042800000000000,"Diligent":n:403e000000000000,},"population":n:402c000000000000,"maxPop":n:402e000000000000,"generations":n:4010000000000000,"knowledgeCount":n:4046000000000000,"knowledgeMax":n:404a800000000000,"villages":[s:"Askvik",s:"Karestead",],"births":n:4030000000000000,"talks":n:408f380000000000,"deaths":{"starvation":n:4008000000000000,"cold":n:0000000000000000,"age":n:4008000000000000,"wolves":n:0000000000000000,},"knowledgeLosses":n:0000000000000000,"rediscoveries":n:0000000000000000,"failedExperiments":n:4057000000000000,"observations":n:4046000000000000,"customsCount":n:4008000000000000,"traditions":[s:"the Sky-Wheel",s:"The Knowing Eye",],"taboos":[],"beliefs":[s:"the Sky-Wheel",s:"The Knowing Eye",],"conversions":n:0000000000000000,"hunts":n:0000000000000000,"harshWinters":n:4008000000000000,"reformations":n:0000000000000000,"worldview":s:"empiric","tabooBreaks":n:0000000000000000,"religions":[undef,],"legends":[s:"Embla Embla the Firebringer.",s:"Ask the First Ask the First the Spearmaker.",s:"Saga Saga the Ironhand.",s:"Kare Kare the Founder.",],"milestones":{"⚙️ Storytelling":s:"year 1","👶 First child":s:"year 1","⚙️ Fire":s:"year 1","⚙️ Rope":s:"year 2","⚙️ Weaving":s:"year 2","⚙️ Counting":s:"year 2","⚙️ Sharpened stone":s:"year 3","⚙️ Music":s:"year 4","⚙️ Calendar":s:"year 4","⚙️ Spear":s:"year 5","⚙️ Axe":s:"year 5","⚙️ Hut":s:"year 6","⚙️ Medicine":s:"year 6","⚙️ Bow":s:"year 9","⚙️ The Wheel":s:"year 9","⚙️ Pottery":s:"year 10","⚙️ Fishing":s:"year 10","⚙️ Kiln":s:"year 12","⚙️ Writing":s:"year 12","⚙️ Philosophy":s:"year 12","⚙️ Law":s:"year 12","⚙️ School":s:"year 12","⚙️ Scholarship":s:"year 12","⚙️ Farming":s:"year 15","⚙️ Composition":s:"year 17","⚙️ Brick":s:"year 17","⚙️ Well":s:"year 17","⚙️ Tin":s:"year 18","⚙️ Granary":s:"year 19","⚙️ Sailing":s:"year 20","⚙️ Mill":s:"year 23","⚙️ Masonry":s:"year 24","⚙️ Road":s:"year 25","⚙️ Architecture":s:"year 25","⚙️ Aqueduct":s:"year 26","⚙️ Windmill":s:"year 26","⚙️ Temple":s:"year 29","🏘️ First village":s:"year 30","🌿 First tradition":s:"year 31","⚙️ University":s:"year 31","⚙️ Glass":s:"year 36","⚙️ Glassblowing":s:"year 36","⚙️ Iron smithing":s:"year 47","⚙️ Metal tools":s:"year 48","⚙️ Copper":s:"year 49","⚙️ Painting":s:"year 49","⚙️ Bronze":s:"year 52",},"status":s:"Alive in year 61","violence":{"steals":n:0000000000000000,"raids":n:0000000000000000,"feuds":n:0000000000000000,"killings":n:0000000000000000,"brawls":n:0000000000000000,"wars":n:0000000000000000,},"trades":n:4050400000000000,"gifts":n:4008000000000000,"leaders":[],"giftWays":[],"wealthTop":s:"Ylva (43)",},"history":{"worldName":s:"Askvik","seed":n:40b0920000000000,"years":n:404e800000000000,"intro":s:"This is the chronicle of Askvik - 61 years, 4 generations, written by no one. Every line below happened.","outro":s:"The chronicle is still being written. 14 souls carry it onward.","chapters":[{"title":s:"The Waking","from":n:3ff0000000000000,"to":n:403e000000000000,"text":[s:"🌍 Four humans wake in an untouched world: Ask the First, Embla the First, Embla, Torv. They know nothing — but they can observe everything. What will they create?",s:"The chronicle marks the year 1, when Ask the First told the day back as a story worth remembering. Ask the First's the tale entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 1, when Embla rubbed sticks together until a spark caught the tinder. Embla's blaze entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 2, when Embla twisted grass fibers into something strong. Embla's braid entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 2, when Embla crossed threads over threads until cloth grew on the frame. Embla's warp-craft entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 2, when Ask the First matched pebble to sheep and found number itself. Ask the First's number entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 3, when Ask the First struck two stones together and kept the sharp shard. Ask the First's knife entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 4, when Embla found that a struck string and a voice could ring together. Embla's the song entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 4, when Embla counted the stars and seasons into a fixed wheel of days. Embla's star-count entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 5, when Ask the First lashed a sharp point to a long shaft. Ask the First's javelin entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 5, when Ask the First bound a hard edge to a wooden shaft. Ask the First's feller entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 6, when Ask the First raised logs against each other into a shelter. Ask the First's shelter entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 6, when Embla learned which leaves ease pain and close a wound. Embla's herb-lore entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 9, when Ask the First bent a young branch with a cord and felt it fight back. Ask the First's birchbow entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 9, when Embla watched a log roll and understood something great. Embla's roller entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 10, when Embla placed shaped clay in the fire and found it hard as stone. Embla's jar entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 10, when Embla let a twisted line sink where the fish gather. Embla's the net entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 12, when Ask the First built a stone chamber that gathered the heat of the fire. Ask the First's hearth entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 12, when Ask the First carved signs into clay so knowledge could outlive its owner. Ask the First's script entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 12, when Ask the First asked not what the world is but why, and wrote it down. Ask the First's the argument entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 12, when Ask the First wrote the customs down so all were judged by one measure. Ask the First's written law entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 12, when Ask the First set the knowing to teach the young in one place. Ask the First's teaching entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 12, when Ask the First gathered writings and studied them as a life's work. Ask the First's the scholar entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 15, when Ask the First pressed spilled seeds into turned soil and waited. Ask the First's the first field entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 17, when Ask the First wrote music down so a song could outlive its singer. Ask the First's written music entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 17, when Ask the First fired shaped clay into blocks that stack true. Ask the First's block entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 17, when Ask the First lined a deep pit with stone to hold clean water. Ask the First's stone well entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 18, when Liv smelted a pale metal too soft to be worth much alone. Liv's the pale metal entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 19, when Liv built a dry raised store so the harvest kept till spring. Liv's silo entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 20, when Liv stretched cloth on a hull and let the wind do the work. Liv's the boat entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 23, when Sten let the wheel drive stones that ground grain. Sten's crusher entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 24, when Liv dressed and fitted stone so it stood without mortar. Liv's stonecraft entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 25, when Liv laid stone in a bed so carts ran true in any weather. Liv's the highway entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 25, when Liv raised the arch, and space opened under stone. Liv's great halls entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 26, when Liv carried water across the valley on arches of stone. Liv's water-bridge entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 26, when Liv set great sails to catch the wind and turn the stones. Liv's tower-mill entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 29, when Sten raised a house for the sacred and gathered the faithful in it. Sten's the shrine-hall entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 30, three huts grew into more, and Askvik was founded - a place with a name, which is the beginning of belonging.",s:"In the year 1, Ask the First began seeing the world differently - believing the sky-wheel turns with the seasons and can be read like tracks in snow. Where others saw patterns, they felt a will behind them.",s:"In the year 2, Embla began seeing the world differently - believing the world repeats and can be understood. Where others saw spirits, they saw patterns.",s:"The winter of year 23 was a hard one. Food ran thin, the cold pressed close, and the fires were fed like gods.",s:"The spear fed the people: hunters brought down deer when the bushes stood bare, and the winters lost some of their terror.",s:"From that day on, Embla was known as Embla the Firebringer.",s:"From that day on, Ask the First was known as Ask the First the Spearmaker.",s:"It is also remembered that Ask the First carries a stick everywhere. It is never used for anything. Once begun, never stopped.",s:"In these years 6 children were born under its skies and 2 lives ended - 2 to hunger.",],},{"title":s:"The Hunger Winter","from":n:403f000000000000,"to":n:404e000000000000,"text":[s:"In the year 31, when Sten joined scholars and students into a lasting house of learning. Sten's the academy entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 36, when Sten melted sand and found something transparent. Sten's flask entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 36, when Sten blew molten sand into clear vessels thin as a bubble. Sten's blown glass entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 47, when Saga watched gleaming metal run from the glowing ore. Saga's ironcraft entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 48, when Saga forged the iron into an edge that never dulled. Saga's plough entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"The chronicle marks the year 49, when Saga coaxed a soft red metal out of green stone in the kiln. Saga's red metal entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 49, when Bjorn ground coloured earth and left an image on the wall. Bjorn's cave-marks entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"It was in the year 52, when Liv poured copper and tin together and woke a hard new metal. Liv's bell-metal entered the world, and nothing was quite the same after.",s:"In the year 53, three huts grew into more, and Karestead was founded - a place with a name, which is the beginning of belonging.",s:"By the year 31, believing the sky-wheel turns with the seasons and can be read like tracks in snow had become simply what one does in Askvik. No council voted.",s:"By the year 31, believing the world repeats and can be understood had become simply what one does in Askvik. It merely became true.",s:"The winter of year 43 was a hard one. Food ran thin, the cold pressed close, and the fires were fed like gods.",s:"The winter of year 58 was a hard one. Food ran thin, the cold pressed close, and the fires were fed like gods.",s:"The spear fed the people: hunters brought down deer when the bushes stood bare, and the winters lost some of their terror.",s:"From that day on, Saga was known as Saga the Ironhand.",s:"From that day on, Kare was known as Kare the Founder.",s:"And in those same years, Embla picks a flower every spring and puts it somewhere no one sees. It began the year Ask the First the Spearmaker died. It has not stopped since.",s:"Meanwhile 10 children were born under its skies and 4 lives ended - 3 to age, 1 to hunger.",],},],},"endState":{"tick":n:40c0e00000000000,"hour":n:4018000000000000,"day":n:4076900000000000,"season":s:"spring","ended":false,"endedYear":undef,"maxPop":n:402e000000000000,"nextId":n:4035000000000000,"nextCustomId":n:4010000000000000,"nextAnimalId":n:4053400000000000,"maxGeneration":n:4010000000000000,"usedNames":n:4034000000000000,"winterSeverity":n:3ff7e0d9e0de6666,"seenWinter":true,"brewing":null,"stats":{"talks":n:408f380000000000,"births":n:4030000000000000,"deaths":{"starvation":n:4008000000000000,"cold":n:0000000000000000,"age":n:4008000000000000,"wolves":n:0000000000000000,},"failedExperiments":n:4057000000000000,"observations":n:4046000000000000,"conversions":n:0000000000000000,"hunts":n:0000000000000000,"harshWinters":n:4008000000000000,"trades":n:4050400000000000,"harvests":n:4024000000000000,"gifts":n:4008000000000000,},"traitSum":{"curiosity":n:4025667b98dfb999,"social":n:4027ec0464157002,"diligence":n:4023715bb1ff4333,"n":n:4034000000000000,},"agents":[{"id":n:4018000000000000,"name":s:"Sten","x":n:404d37ec70140493,"y":n:4045f7cb598efdd5,"age":n:404b31c71c71c71c,"gen":n:4000000000000000,"lifespan":n:4052400000000000,"hunger":n:404ab9999999a3bd,"energy":n:4043c00000000000,"warmth":n:4059000000000000,"social":n:4057f33333333336,"inv":{"wood":n:4014000000000000,"clay":n:4000000000000000,"stone":n:3ff0000000000000,"coal":n:3ff0000000000000,"sand":n:0000000000000000,},"knows":Set[s:"numbers",s:"sharp",s:"axe",s:"fire",s:"spear",s:"calendar",s:"storytelling",s:"rope",s:"medicine",s:"weaving",s:"song",s:"bow",s:"pottery",s:"fishing",s:"hut",s:"farming",s:"kiln",s:"composition",s:"law",s:"wheel",s:"writing",s:"brick",s:"philosophy",s:"well",s:"tin",s:"granary",s:"mill",s:"sailing",s:"masonry",s:"road",s:"architecture",s:"school",s:"aqueduct",s:"windmill",s:"scholarship",s:"temple",s:"university",s:"glass",s:"glassblowing",s:"painting",],"obs":Set[s:"starsWheel",s:"sharpShards",s:"logsRoll",s:"weights